      <details class="online-privacy online-verification"><summary>How ranked times work</summary><p>Times are recalculated from command replays on the server. This verifies the route and movement, not whether a run was human-controlled. Use the default movement rules and finish without pausing or practice assists. Eligible guest runs can be saved after signing in from the finish screen.</p></details>
