      <details class="online-privacy"><summary>How points work</summary><p>Each map counts once: your best verified time. A completion earns 100 points, plus up to 400 for your position on that map’s leaderboard. The performance part is 400 divided by the square root of your place, rounded down. Equal times earn equal points. Tier 2 maps count double.</p><p>Repeating a finish earns no extra points. Positions and points can change when other players improve. Solo and multiplayer share the same ranks. Practice and unverified runs do not count.</p></details>
